: text;\">Python provides a special syntax for accessing elements relative to the end of the list using negative indices:</span></span></span></span></p><div class=\"editor-code-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n            <div class=\"editor-code-top-bar\">\n                <div class=\"editor-code-filename-group\">\n                    <i class=\"fa-regular fa-file-code\" style=\"color: #6b7280; font-size: 1.1rem;\"></i>\n                    <input type=\"text\" class=\"editor-code-filename\" placeholder=\"File name (e.g. main.py)\" value=\"bicycles.py \">\n                </div>\n                <select class=\"editor-code-mode-select\" title=\"Component Type\">\n                    <option value=\"interactive\" selected=\"selected\">Interactive Exercise (Console + Output)</option>\n                    <option value=\"snippet\">Code Example Only (Console)</option>\n                </select>\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"editor-delete-block-btn\" title=\"Delete Block\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-trash-can\"></i></button>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"editor-code-card console-card-pane\" style=\"grid-column: auto;\">\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-header\" style=\"background: #06b6d4 !important;\"></div>\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-body\">\n                    <div class=\"editor-code-title-row\">\n                        <div class=\"editor-code-title\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\"></i> Console</div>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"console-action-btn run-btn\" title=\"Run Code\" style=\"display: flex;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-play\"></i> Run</button>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"editor-code-desc\">Provide example code for students.</p>\n                    <div class=\"editor-console-box\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-gramm=\"false\" data-gramm_editor=\"false\" data-enable-grammarly=\"false\" placeholder=\"e.g. print(&quot;Hello, World!&quot;)\"># bicycles.py <div><br></div><div>bicycles = [\'trek\', \'cannondale\', \'redline\', \'specialized\'] </div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div># Access the last item </div><div><br></div><div>print(bicycles[-1]) </div><div> </div><div><br></div><div># Access the second to last item </div><div><br></div><div>print(bicycles[-2]) </div></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"editor-code-card output-card-pane\" style=\"display: flex;\">\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-header\" style=\"background: #06b6d4 !important;\"></div>\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-body\">\n                    <div class=\"editor-code-title-row\">\n                        <div class=\"editor-code-title\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-terminal\"></i> Expected Output</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"editor-code-desc output-desc-text\">Output is dynamically generated based on code execution.</p>\n                    <div class=\"editor-output-box\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-gramm=\"false\" data-gramm_editor=\"false\" data-enable-grammarly=\"false\" placeholder=\"Output will be automatically evaluated from code execution...\">specialized\nredline</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div><blockquote><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-PH\" lang=\"EN-PH\" class=\"TextRun SCXW30620071 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW30620071 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">NOTE</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW30620071 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">:</span></span><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-PH\" lang=\"EN-PH\" class=\"TextRun SCXW30620071 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW30620071 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\"> Index -1 always returns the last item in a list, even if the list changes size over time!</span></span></blockquote></div></span></div>');
INSERT INTO `lesson_content_tbl` (`lesson_content_id`, `resource_id`, `content_body`) VALUES
(26, 26, '<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW194627336 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"Paragraph SCXW194627336 BCX0\" paraid=\"2058421213\" paraeid=\"{595612a1-835d-45af-9cb2-6be7374024a7}{212}\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-PH\" lang=\"EN-PH\" class=\"TextRun SCXW194627336 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW194627336 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">You can use individual values from a list just as you would any other variable.&nbsp;</span></span></p></div><div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW194627336 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"Paragraph SCXW194627336 BCX0\" paraid=\"558264453\" paraeid=\"{595612a1-835d-45af-9cb2-6be7374024a7}{218}\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-PH\" lang=\"EN-PH\" class=\"TextRun SCXW194627336 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW194627336 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">For example, you can use f-strings to create a message based on a value from a list.</span></span></p></div><div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW194627336 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"Paragraph SCXW194627336 BCX0\" paraid=\"1653209178\" paraeid=\"{595612a1-835d-45af-9cb2-6be7374024a7}{224}\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;\"><br></p></div><div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW194627336 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"Paragraph SCXW194627336 BCX0\" paraid=\"643256319\" paraeid=\"{595612a1-835d-45af-9cb2-6be7374024a7}{228}\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-PH\" lang=\"EN-PH\" class=\"TextRun SCXW194627336 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW194627336 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">Let\'s try pulling the first bicycle from the list and composing a message using that value:</span></span></p><div class=\"editor-code-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n            <div class=\"editor-code-top-bar\">\n                <div class=\"editor-code-filename-group\">\n                    <i class=\"fa-regular fa-file-code\" style=\"color: #6b7280; font-size: 1.1rem;\"></i>\n                    <input type=\"text\" class=\"editor-code-filename\" placeholder=\"File name (e.g. main.py)\" value=\"bicycles.py \">\n                </div>\n                <select class=\"editor-code-mode-select\" title=\"Component Type\">\n                    <option value=\"interactive\" selected=\"selected\">Interactive Exercise (Console + Output)</option>\n                    <option value=\"snippet\">Code Example Only (Console)</option>\n                </select>\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"editor-delete-block-btn\" title=\"Delete Block\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-trash-can\"></i></button>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"editor-code-card console-card-pane\" style=\"grid-column: auto;\">\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-header\" style=\"background: #06b6d4 !important;\"></div>\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-body\">\n                    <div class=\"editor-code-title-row\">\n                        <div class=\"editor-code-title\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\"></i> Console</div>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"console-action-btn run-btn\" title=\"Run Code\" style=\"display: flex;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-play\"></i> Run</button>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"editor-code-desc\">Provide example code for students.</p>\n                    <div class=\"editor-console-box\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-gramm=\"false\" data-gramm_editor=\"false\" data-enable-grammarly=\"false\" placeholder=\"e.g. print(&quot;Hello, World!&quot;)\"># bicycles.py <div><br></div><div>bicycles = [\'trek\', \'cannondale\', \'redline\', \'specialized\'] </div><div>message = f\"My first bicycle was a {bicycles[0].title()}.\" </div><div>print(message)</div></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"editor-code-card output-card-pane\" style=\"display: flex;\">\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-header\" style=\"background: #06b6d4 !important;\"></div>\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-body\">\n                    <div class=\"editor-code-title-row\">\n                        <div class=\"editor-code-title\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-terminal\"></i> Expected Output</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"editor-code-desc output-desc-text\">Output is dynamically generated based on code execution.</p>\n                    <div class=\"editor-output-box\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-gramm=\"false\" data-gramm_editor=\"false\" data-enable-grammarly=\"false\" placeholder=\"Output will be automatically evaluated from code execution...\">My first bicycle was a Trek.</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div><div><div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW245366966 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;\"><p class=\"Paragraph SCXW245366966 BCX0\" paraid=\"1253976103\" paraeid=\"{38f2ef21-4827-40a6-874f-1134cb9b6b8f}{91}\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW245366966 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW245366966 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">What is happening?</span></span></p></div><div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW245366966 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;\"><p class=\"Paragraph SCXW245366966 BCX0\" paraid=\"554020530\" paraeid=\"{38f2ef21-4827-40a6-874f-1134cb9b6b8f}{101}\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW245366966 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW245366966 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">The list </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW245366966 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">of </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW245366966 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">bicycles is created</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW245366966 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW245366966 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\"> bicycles[0] </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW245366966 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">pulls</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW245366966 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\"> the first item (\'trek\'), .title() capitalizes it to \'Trek\', an f-string</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW245366966 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\"> </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW245366966 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">inserts it into a message, and print(message) displays the final output: My first bicycle was a Trek.</span></span></p></div></div></div>'),
(27, 27, '<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW13533278 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"Paragraph SCXW13533278 BCX0\" paraid=\"1284574653\" paraeid=\"{38f2ef21-4827-40a6-874f-1134cb9b6b8f}{201}\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-PH\" lang=\"EN-PH\" class=\"TextRun SCXW13533278 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW13533278 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">Most lists you create will be dynamic, meaning you will create a list and then add or remove elements as your program runs.</span></span></p></div><div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW13533278 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"Paragraph SCXW13533278 BCX0\" paraid=\"1942550184\" paraeid=\"{38f2ef21-4827-40a6-874f-1134cb9b6b8f}{211}\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-PH\" lang=\"EN-PH\" class=\"TextRun SCXW13533278 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW13533278 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">To change an element, use the name of the list followed by the index of the item you want to change, and assign it a new value.</span></span></p></div><div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW13533278 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"Paragraph SCXW13533278 BCX0\" paraid=\"261988334\" paraeid=\"{38f2ef21-4827-40a6-874f-1134cb9b6b8f}{217}\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;\"><br></p></div><div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW13533278 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"Paragraph SCXW13533278 BCX0\" paraid=\"253950645\" paraeid=\"{38f2ef21-4827-40a6-874f-1134cb9b6b8f}{225}\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-PH\" lang=\"EN-PH\" class=\"TextRun SCXW13533278 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW13533278 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">Example 1</span></span></p><div class=\"editor-code-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n            <div class=\"editor-code-top-bar\">\n                <div class=\"editor-code-filename-group\">\n                    <i class=\"fa-regular fa-file-code\" style=\"color: #6b7280; font-size: 1.1rem;\"></i>\n                    <input type=\"text\" class=\"editor-code-filename\" placeholder=\"File name (e.g. main.py)\" value=\"motorcycles.py \">\n                </div>\n                <select class=\"editor-code-mode-select\" title=\"Component Type\">\n                    <option value=\"interactive\" selected=\"selected\">Interactive Exercise (Console + Output)</option>\n                    <option value=\"snippet\">Code Example Only (Console)</option>\n                </select>\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"editor-delete-block-btn\" title=\"Delete Block\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-trash-can\"></i></button>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"editor-code-card console-card-pane\" style=\"grid-column: auto;\">\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-header\" style=\"background: #06b6d4 !important;\"></div>\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-body\">\n                    <div class=\"editor-code-title-row\">\n                        <div class=\"editor-code-title\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\"></i> Console</div>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"console-action-btn run-btn\" title=\"Run Code\" style=\"display: flex;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-play\"></i> Run</button>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"editor-code-desc\">Provide example code for students.</p>\n                    <div class=\"editor-console-box\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-gramm=\"false\" data-gramm_editor=\"false\" data-enable-grammarly=\"false\" placeholder=\"e.g. print(&quot;Hello, World!&quot;)\"># motorcycles.py <div><br></div><div>motorcycles = [\'honda\', \'yamaha\', \'suzuki\'] </div><div><br></div><div>print(motorcycles) </div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div># Change the first item (\'honda\') to \'ducati\' </div><div><br></div><div>motorcycles[0] = \'ducati\' </div><div><br></div><div>print(motorcycles) </div><div><br></div><div> </div></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"editor-code-card output-card-pane\" style=\"display: flex;\">\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-header\" style=\"background: #06b6d4 !important;\"></div>\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-body\">\n                    <div class=\"editor-code-title-row\">\n                        <div class=\"editor-code-title\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-terminal\"></i> Expected Output</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"editor-code-desc output-desc-text\">Output is dynamically generated based on code execution.</p>\n                    <div class=\"editor-output-box\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-gramm=\"false\" data-gramm_editor=\"false\" data-enable-grammarly=\"false\" placeholder=\"Output will be automatically evaluated from code execution...\">[\'honda\', \'yamaha\', \'suzuki\']\n[\'ducati\', \'yamaha\', \'suzuki\']</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div><div><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SC