t-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW250126806 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\"> The reverse() method changes the original order of a list backward, reversing the items in place without sorting them alphabetically.</span></span></p></li></ul></div><div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW250126806 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; position: relative; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><ul class=\"BulletListStyle1 SCXW250126806 BCX0\" role=\"list\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; cursor: text; font-family: verdana; overflow: visible;\"><li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"97\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\" class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW250126806 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; display: block; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline;\"><p class=\"Paragraph SCXW250126806 BCX0\" paraid=\"1284161633\" paraeid=\"{e32e7cac-9ef9-4d35-9714-441aa32492fb}{251}\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-PH\" lang=\"EN-PH\" class=\"TextRun SCXW250126806 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW250126806 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">Permanence:</span></span><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-PH\" lang=\"EN-PH\" class=\"TextRun SCXW250126806 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW250126806 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\"> It changes the order of the list permanently rather than just displaying it temporarily.</span></span></p></li></ul></div><div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW250126806 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; position: relative;\"><ul class=\"BulletListStyle1 SCXW250126806 BCX0\" role=\"list\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana; font-size: 12px; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; cursor: text; overflow: visible;\"><li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"97\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\" class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW250126806 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; display: block; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline;\"><p class=\"Paragraph SCXW250126806 BCX0\" paraid=\"33758390\" paraeid=\"{57121697-2791-4b24-90c6-52785660e40e}{4}\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext; text-align: left;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-PH\" lang=\"EN-PH\" class=\"TextRun SCXW250126806 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW250126806 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">Reversibility:</span></span><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-PH\" lang=\"EN-PH\" class=\"TextRun SCXW250126806 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW250126806 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\"> Even though the change is permanent, it is fully reversible. You can return the list to its exact original order at any time simply by calling reverse() a second time.</span></span></p></li></ul><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br></span></font></div><div class=\"editor-code-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n            <div class=\"editor-code-top-bar\">\n                <div class=\"editor-code-filename-group\">\n                    <i class=\"fa-regular fa-file-code\" style=\"color: #6b7280; font-size: 1.1rem;\"></i>\n                    <input type=\"text\" class=\"editor-code-filename\" placeholder=\"File name (e.g. main.py)\" value=\"cars.py \">\n                </div>\n                <select class=\"editor-code-mode-select\" title=\"Component Type\">\n                    <option value=\"interactive\" selected=\"selected\">Interactive Exercise (Console + Output)</option>\n                    <option value=\"snippet\">Code Example Only (Console)</option>\n                </select>\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"editor-delete-block-btn\" title=\"Delete Block\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-trash-can\"></i></button>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"editor-code-card console-card-pane\" style=\"grid-column: auto;\">\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-header\" style=\"background: #06b6d4 !important;\"></div>\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-body\">\n                    <div class=\"editor-code-title-row\">\n                        <div class=\"editor-code-title\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\"></i> Console</div>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"console-action-btn run-btn\" title=\"Run Code\" style=\"display: flex;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-play\"></i> Run</button>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"editor-code-desc\">Provide example code for students.</p>\n                    <div class=\"editor-console-box\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-gramm=\"false\" data-gramm_editor=\"false\" data-enable-grammarly=\"false\" placeholder=\"e.g. print(&quot;Hello, World!&quot;)\"># cars.py <div><br></div><div>cars = [\'bmw\', \'audi\', \'toyota\', \'subaru\'] </div><div>print(cars) </div><div>cars.reverse() </div><div>print(cars)</div></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"editor-code-card output-card-pane\" style=\"display: flex;\">\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-header\" style=\"background: #06b6d4 !important;\"></div>\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-body\">\n                    <div class=\"editor-code-title-row\">\n                        <div class=\"editor-code-title\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-terminal\"></i> Expected Output</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"editor-code-desc output-desc-text\">Output is dynamically generated based on code execution.</p>\n                    <div class=\"editor-output-box\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-gramm=\"false\" data-gramm_editor=\"false\" data-enable-grammarly=\"false\" placeholder=\"Output will be automatically evaluated from code execution...\">[\'bmw\', \'audi\', \'toyota\', \'subaru\']\n[\'subaru\', \'toyota\', \'audi\', \'bmw\']</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div><div><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW36661735 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW36661735 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">Exa</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW36661735 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">mple 2</span></span></div><div class=\"editor-code-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n            <div class=\"editor-code-top-bar\">\n                <div class=\"editor-code-filename-group\">\n                    <i class=\"fa-regular fa-file-code\" style=\"color: #6b7280; font-size: 1.1rem;\"></i>\n                    <input type=\"text\" class=\"editor-code-filename\" placeholder=\"File name (e.g. main.py)\" value=\"colors.py \">\n                </div>\n                <select class=\"editor-code-mode-select\" title=\"Component Type\">\n                    <option value=\"interactive\" selected=\"selected\">Interactive Exercise (Console + Output)</option>\n                    <option value=\"snippet\">Code Example Only (Console)</option>\n                </select>\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"editor-delete-block-btn\" title=\"Delete Block\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-trash-can\"></i></button>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"editor-code-card console-card-pane\" style=\"grid-column: auto;\">\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-header\" style=\"background: #06b6d4 !important;\"></div>\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-body\">\n                    <div class=\"editor-code-title-row\">\n                        <div class=\"editor-code-title\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code\"></i> Console</div>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"console-action-btn run-btn\" title=\"Run Code\" style=\"display: flex;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-play\"></i> Run</button>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"editor-code-desc\">Provide example code for students.</p>\n                    <div class=\"editor-console-box\" contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-gramm=\"false\" data-gramm_editor=\"false\" data-enable-grammarly=\"false\" placeholder=\"e.g. print(&quot;Hello, World!&quot;)\"># colors.py <div><br></div><div>colors = [\'red\', \'green\', \'blue\', \'yellow\'] </div><div>print(colors) </div><div><br></div><div>colors.reverse() </div><div>print(colors) </div><div><br></div><div>colors.reverse() </div><div>print(colors)</div></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"editor-code-card output-card-pane\" style=\"display: flex;\">\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-header\" style=\"background: #06b6d4 !important;\"></div>\n                <div class=\"editor-code-card-body\">\n                    <div class=\"editor-code-title-row\">\n                        <div class=\"editor-code-title\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-terminal\"></i> Expected Output</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"editor-code-desc output-desc-text\">Output is dynamically generated based on code execution.</p>\n                    <div class=\"editor-output-box\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-gramm=\"false\" data-gramm_editor=\"false\" data-enable-grammarly=\"false\" placeholder=\"Output will be automatically evaluated from code execution...\">[\'bmw\', \'audi\', \'toyota\', \'subaru\']\n[\'subaru\', \'toyota\', \'audi\', \'bmw\']\n[\'red\', \'green\', \'blue\', \'yellow\']\n[\'yellow\', \'blue\', \'green\', \'red\']\n[\'red\', \'green\', \'blue\', \'yellow\']</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div><div><div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW254257373 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"Paragraph SCXW254257373 BCX0\" paraid=\"45349898\" paraeid=\"{7ba66c38-6bf8-4069-95c8-a73449655f6d}{80}\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-PH\" lang=\"EN-PH\" class=\"TextRun SCXW254257373 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW254257373 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">What is Happening?</span></span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW254257373 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; cursor: default; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(96, 96, 96) !important; border-color: rgb(96, 96, 96) !important;\">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW254257373 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; position: relative; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-PH\" lang=\"EN-PH\" class=\"TextRun SCXW254257373 BCX0\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: windowtext; font-size: 11pt; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW254257373 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">&nbsp;The list colors </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW254257373 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">is</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW254257373 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\"> created in its original sequence, the first </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW254257373 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">colors.reverse</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW254257373 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">() permanently flips the order of the list elements in place, and calling </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW254257373 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">colors.reverse</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW254257373 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">() a second time flips them back, successfully reverting the list to its exact original order.</span></span></div><div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW254257373 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; position: relative; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><br></span><div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW86080887 BCX0\" style=\"font-size: 12px; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; display: inline !important;\"><blockquote><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-PH\" lang=\"EN-PH\" class=\"TextRun SCXW86080887 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW86080887 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">NOTE</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW86080887 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">:</span></span><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-PH\" lang=\"EN-PH\" class=\"TextRun SCXW86080887 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW86080887 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-PH\" lang=\"EN-PH\" class=\"TextRun SCXW86080887 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW86080887 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">Permanent, but Reversible:</span></span><span data-contrast=\"auto\" xml:lang=\"EN-PH\" lang=\"EN-PH\" class=\"TextRun SCXW86080887 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW86080887 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\"> reverse() changes the order permanently, but you can revert to the original order at any time by calling </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW86080887 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">cars.reverse</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW86080887 BCX0\" style=\"-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; user-select: text;\">() a second time.</span></span></blockquote></div></div></div>');
