(919, 238, 'C', 'Code doesn\'t need comments.', 0, 'Keep it up! readability includes comments. you\'re getting closer!'),
(920, 238, 'D', 'Code is read far more often than it is written.', 1, 'Correct! the lesson states that the core philosophy in python is simple: code is read far more often than it is written.'),
